  "schema": "li-exact-v1",
  "scope": "The explicit 31-vertex tree is a tree of maximum degree four with a unique degree-four vertex whose only leaf neighbour is vertex 1, and is neither a spider nor a caterpillar. All 6,842 integer partitions of 31 occur as complete lists of connected-component sizes of spanning subgraphs of this tree. Exactly eight actual connected vertex partitions have type (3,2^14). The coefficient of e_2^14 e_3 in the full elementary coordinates of the proper-colouring polynomial is 29 for every finite colour type of cardinality at least 31. The ambient object is a finite multivariate polynomial expressed using the inverse of MvPolynomial.esymmAlgEquiv. This snapshot contains the original 38-module contribution with compatibility repairs; it does not include the supplementary negative coefficient or construct an infinite-variable symmetric-function ring.",
